{
 "encounter_id": "00757",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm fine, doc. Just a stiff neck from the accident. The guy ran a red light and hit my driver's side. The ambulance people insisted I come in."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm glad you came. When was the accident?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About two hours ago. I've got a pain at the back of my neck, that's all, nothing serious."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So, neck pain since the crash, two hours. Is it stiff as well?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit stiff turning to the left. I can still do it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A mild one, started in the ambulance."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How about your shoulders, arms?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The left shoulder aches where the belt caught me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you hit your head or black out at any point?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. I was awake the whole time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or tingling in your arms or hands?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No numbness. No tingling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So no blackout, no tingling. What medications do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lisinopril, 20 mg, once a day. Metformin, 1000 mg, twice a day. And I took ibuprofen, 400 mg, in the ambulance."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Any allergies, any drug allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morphine. When I was in my twenties it made me throw up. I've avoided it since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Other medical conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, type 2 diabetes, asthma, and sleep apnea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgeries?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gallbladder out, in 2014."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart disease or stroke in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a stroke."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I quit smoking five years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of beers on weekends."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Electrician. I'm up on ladders all day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Golf, when the weather's okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me get your vitals. Blood pressure 152 over 92, pulse 96, temperature 36.9, oxygen 97 percent, respiratory rate 18, and your weight is 94 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's just the adrenaline. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Probably. Let me feel your neck. Tell me if anything hurts.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There. Right there, a bit. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness over the muscles on both sides of the neck, but no tenderness over the bones in the middle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "See, it's nothing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You've got a seat belt mark on the left shoulder, and I can see a bruise coming up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the belt, yeah. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble breathing, chest pain from the belt?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. Breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What you're telling me is that you can move your neck and there's no tingling. That's reassuring. But I can't rule out a fracture of the neck bones, and with a collision like this we scan."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A scan? For a stiff neck? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "For safety. I'd like to arrange a CT scan of the neck, and an X-ray of the left shoulder."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long will it take? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "About an hour. I'd also like to get a CT scan of the head, because of the headache."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "If you say so. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Until it's done, you stay lying flat with the collar on. I'll come back with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Alright, doc. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If any numbness or weakness appears before the scan, tell the nurse straight away and we'll act immediately."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do. ~"
  }
 ],
